# What the EAS build server must never receive (worklog, 2026-08-23).
#
# EAS packs the project from the repo root. Without this file the archive
# swallowed a locally generated `mobile/android/` whose autolinking config
# carried absolute Windows paths — which broke the Linux builder with
# "projectDirectory .../mobile/android/D:/xampp/... does not exist" — and
# weighed the upload down to 438 MB. The builder regenerates every one of
# these directories itself.

.git/
**/node_modules/

# Locally generated native projects — prebuild output, never source.
mobile/android/
mobile/ios/
mobile/.expo/

# The other apps' dependency and build trees — not part of a mobile build.
backend/vendor/
backend/storage/framework/
backend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/node_modules/

# Local artifacts.
*.apk
*.log
